<article class="inchy-shell inchy-guide">
  <header>
    <a class="inchy-quiet-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">← BACK TO {% render 'inchy-logo', inline: true %}</a>
    {% case section.settings.kind %}
      {% when 'research' %}
        <h1>SATIETY. GLP-1.<br>THE RESEARCH.</h1>
        <p>A closer look at the laboratory research into sacha inchi peptides, and what the findings mean.</p>
      {% when 'how-to-use' %}
        <h1>A SIMPLE ADDITION.<br>AN EVERYDAY ROUTINE.</h1>
        <p>{% render 'inchy-logo', inline: true %} is an unflavoured sacha inchi nutraceutical designed to mix into food or drinks.</p>
      {% when 'support' %}
        <h1>HELP & CONTACT.</h1>
        <p>Questions about the product, your order or delivery? Get in touch below.</p>
    {% endcase %}
  </header>

  {% case section.settings.kind %}
    {% when 'research' %}
      <section class="inchy-guide__row"><h2>RESEARCH SHOWS</h2><div>
        <p>Researchers isolated peptides from hydrolysed sacha inchi meal and tested their effects on DPP-IV. Several inhibited the enzyme in laboratory assays.</p>
        <p class="inchy-small">Zhang et al. · 2023 · Laboratory study</p>
        <a class="inchy-text-link" href="https://doi.org/10.1002/jsfa.12464">READ THE ORIGINAL STUDY →</a>
      </div></section>
      <section class="inchy-guide__row"><h2>WHY IT MATTERS</h2><div>
        <p>GLP-1 is a hormone involved in signalling fullness. An enzyme called DPP-IV breaks it down.</p>
        <p>The research examines how specific peptides interact with this enzyme.</p>
      </div></section>
      <section class="inchy-guide__row"><h2>WHAT DOES<br>THIS MEAN?</h2><div>
        <p>In laboratory tests, small fragments of sacha inchi protein, called peptides, slowed this enzyme’s activity.</p>
        <p>In principle, slowing that breakdown could allow GLP-1 to stay active for longer. This study did not establish that effect in people.</p>
      </div></section>
      <section class="inchy-guide__row"><h2>WHAT THIS<br>DOES NOT PROVE</h2><div>
        <p>This was not a human trial of finished {% render 'inchy-logo', inline: true %}. It does not establish that taking {% render 'inchy-logo', inline: true %} increases GLP-1, changes appetite or causes weight loss.</p>
        <p>The preparation and concentrations used in a laboratory study cannot be assumed to match a serving of the finished product.</p>
      </div></section>
      <section class="inchy-guide__row"><h2>THE SOURCE</h2><div>
        <p>Isolation and identification of dipeptidyl peptidase-IV inhibitory peptides from Sacha inchi meal.</p>
        <p class="inchy-small">Journal of the Science of Food and Agriculture · 2023<br>DOI: 10.1002/jsfa.12464</p>
        <div class="inchy-guide__links"><a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36692392/">PubMed abstract</a><a href="https://doi.org/10.1002/jsfa.12464">Publisher’s article</a></div>
      </div></section>
    {% when 'how-to-use' %}
      <section class="inchy-guide__row"><h2>01 / MEASURE</h2><div>{% render 'inchy-directions' %}</div></section>
      <section class="inchy-guide__row"><h2>02 / MIX</h2><div>
        <p>Add your measured serving to food or a drink and mix thoroughly to distribute the powder. Yogurt, oats and smoothies are ways to include it in your routine.</p>
        <p>Choose something you already enjoy eating or drinking. Follow the directions on your pouch for the amount to use.</p>
      </div></section>
      <img class="inchy-guide__image" src="{{ 'inchy-routine.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1942" height="809" loading="lazy" alt="Examples of mixing INCHY powder into food and drinks">
      <section class="inchy-guide__row"><h2>03 / YOUR ROUTINE</h2><div>
        <p>Choose a familiar part of your day and follow the frequency stated on your pouch. Check the label for the full directions before you begin.</p>
      </div></section>
      <section class="inchy-guide__row"><h2>GOOD TO KNOW</h2><div>
        <h3>TASTE & TEXTURE</h3><p>Unflavoured means no added flavouring; it does not mean tasteless. Sacha inchi has its own taste and texture, which can come through depending on what you mix it with.</p>
        <h3 class="inchy-spaced-heading">STORAGE</h3>{% if settings.inchy_storage != blank %}<p>{{ settings.inchy_storage | escape | newline_to_br }}</p>{% else %}<p>Follow the storage instructions and date shown on your pouch.</p>{% endif %}
        <h3 class="inchy-spaced-heading">PRODUCT SUITABILITY</h3><p>Read the ingredients and allergen information on your label. If you take medication, including a GLP-1 medicine, ask your clinician or pharmacist about suitability before use.</p>
      </div></section>
    {% when 'support' %}
      <section class="inchy-guide__row" id="delivery"><h2>DELIVERY</h2><div>
        {% if settings.inchy_prelaunch %}
          <p>INCHY is preparing to launch in the United States. Online ordering has not opened yet. Delivery options and charges will be available before launch.</p>
          <a class="inchy-text-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=launch">GET U.S. LAUNCH UPDATES →</a>
        {% elsif shop.shipping_policy != blank %}
          <div class="inchy-policy-copy">{{ shop.shipping_policy.body }}</div>
          <a class="inchy-text-link" href="{{ shop.shipping_policy.url }}">SHIPPING POLICY →</a>
        {% else %}
          <p>For delivery availability, shipping costs and estimated timing, contact us with your country and postal code before ordering.</p>
        {% endif %}
        <a class="inchy-quiet-link" href="#contact">ASK ABOUT DELIVERY →</a>
      </div></section>
      <section class="inchy-guide__row" id="returns"><h2>RETURNS</h2><div>
        {% if settings.inchy_prelaunch %}
          <p>Return conditions will be available before online ordering opens. Contact us if you have a product question in the meantime.</p>
        {% elsif shop.refund_policy != blank %}
          <div class="inchy-policy-copy">{{ shop.refund_policy.body }}</div>
          <a class="inchy-text-link" href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}">RETURNS POLICY →</a>
        {% else %}
          <p>Contact us to confirm return conditions before ordering. For an existing order, include your order number and what you need help with.</p>
        {% endif %}
        <a class="inchy-quiet-link" href="#contact">ASK ABOUT A RETURN →</a>
      </div></section>
      <section class="inchy-guide__row"><h2>PRODUCT QUESTIONS</h2><div>
        <p>Explore the usage guide for mixing and routine information, or the research guide for the study behind our laboratory summary.</p>
        <div class="inchy-guide__links"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=how-to-use">How to use</a><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=research">The research</a></div>
      </div></section>
  {% endcase %}
  {% unless section.settings.kind == 'support' %}<a class="inchy-button" href="{% render 'inchy-shop-url' %}">SHOP {% render 'inchy-logo', inline: true %}</a>{% endunless %}
</article>
{% schema %}
{"name":"INCHY guide","settings":[{"type":"select","id":"kind","label":"Guide","options":[{"value":"research","label":"Research"},{"value":"how-to-use","label":"How to use"},{"value":"support","label":"Support"}],"default":"research"}],"presets":[{"name":"INCHY guide"}]}
{% endschema %}
